<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1446235140"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1508952536"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="You &amp; I"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="GENERATIONS from EXILE TRIBE"/><amll:meta key="album" value="You &amp; I"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:26.047"><div begin="00:07.313" end="03:26.127"><p begin="00:07.313" end="00:11.715" itunes:key="L23">We will be together forever and ever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们将永生永世相伴</span></p><p begin="00:12.066" end="00:16.720" itunes:key="L24">一瞬交差した視線で撃ち抜かれて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一瞬的视线交错击穿了我的心</span></p><p begin="00:16.819" end="00:21.567" itunes:key="L25">微かに触れた指で熱くなって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">指尖轻微的触碰变得灼热</span></p><p begin="00:21.918" end="00:25.758" itunes:key="L26">僕を包むよ Fall like rain<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你像一场雨</span></p><p begin="00:25.768" end="00:28.274" itunes:key="L27">You know what I'm sayin'<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你知道我在说什么</span></p><p begin="00:28.518" end="00:31.082" itunes:key="L28">見つけた You're my destiny<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我找到了</span></p><p begin="00:31.092" end="00:33.712" itunes:key="L29">世界中を駆け巡る旅を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你就是我的命中注定</span></p><p begin="00:33.722" end="00:35.951" itunes:key="L30">君とふたりで始めたいんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">环游世界的旅行</span></p><p begin="00:36.038" end="00:38.279" itunes:key="L31">Looking through the eyes of a little child<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">望进你孩童般纯真的双眸</span></p><p begin="00:38.460" end="00:40.711" itunes:key="L32">握った手を離さないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">紧握双手绝不放开</span></p><p begin="00:41.110" end="00:44.988" itunes:key="L33">僕だけに見せてよ Your smile<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只为我展露</span></p><p begin="00:44.998" end="00:47.311" itunes:key="L34">君は You're mine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的微笑吧</span></p><p begin="00:48.370" end="00:51.168" itunes:key="L35">ひとつになろう You &amp; I<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让你我的心交织在一起</span></p><p begin="00:53.089" end="00:57.547" itunes:key="L36">ひとつになろう You &amp; I, I, I<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让你我的心交织在一起</span></p><p begin="00:57.927" end="01:00.260" itunes:key="L37">変わりゆく世界で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这瞬息万变的世界</span></p><p begin="01:00.338" end="01:04.998" itunes:key="L38">これからもふたりStay together forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们从今以后</span></p><p begin="01:07.478" end="01:10.321" itunes:key="L39">ひとつになろう You &amp; I<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让你我的心交织在一起</span></p><p begin="01:19.220" end="01:23.827" itunes:key="L40">乾ききった砂漠を 走り抜けて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">奔跑穿越枯竭干涸的沙漠</span></p><p begin="01:24.070" end="01:28.721" itunes:key="L41">絶え間なく波打つ 海を渡って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渡过波涛翻涌不绝的大海</span></p><p begin="01:29.118" end="01:32.932" itunes:key="L42">君に出会えた Through the pain<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与你相遇</span></p><p begin="01:33.042" end="01:35.202" itunes:key="L43">I just can't explain</p><p begin="01:35.751" end="01:38.284" itunes:key="L44">見つけた You're my everything<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我寻找到了</span></p><p begin="01:38.294" end="01:40.755" itunes:key="L45">例えば明日地球が終わって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">假如明天就是地球末日</span></p><p begin="01:40.854" end="01:43.106" itunes:key="L46">すべて消えて失くなっても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算一切都会消失</span></p><p begin="01:43.222" end="01:45.492" itunes:key="L47">Hold you in my arms, you'll be in my heart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也会拥你入怀 你会永远在我心中</span></p><p begin="01:45.626" end="01:47.913" itunes:key="L48">君がいるならそれでいい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要有你便已足够</span></p><p begin="01:48.223" end="01:52.143" itunes:key="L49">僕の胸で Come feel the fire<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">到我心中</span></p><p begin="01:52.253" end="01:54.835" itunes:key="L50">Let me take you higher<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我给你更好的享受</span></p><p begin="01:55.440" end="01:58.331" itunes:key="L51">ひとつになろう You &amp; I<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让你我的心交织在一起</span></p><p begin="02:00.212" end="02:04.804" itunes:key="L52">ひとつになろう You &amp; I, I, I<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让你我的心交织在一起</span></p><p begin="02:05.090" end="02:07.403" itunes:key="L53">変わりゆく世界で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这瞬息万变的世界</span></p><p begin="02:07.413" end="02:12.196" itunes:key="L54">これからもふたりStay together forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们从今以后</span></p><p begin="02:14.690" end="02:17.574" itunes:key="L55">ひとつになろう You &amp; I<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让你我的心交织在一起</span></p><p begin="02:36.552" end="02:41.050" itunes:key="L56">不確かな毎日を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">迷茫地生活在</span></p><p begin="02:41.311" end="02:45.810" itunes:key="L57">戸惑うように生きてた僕に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">捉摸不定的每一天中</span></p><p begin="02:45.888" end="02:49.576" itunes:key="L58">ここにいる意味を君が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是你告诉了我</span></p><p begin="02:49.586" end="02:57.665" itunes:key="L59">教えてくれた You make me feel alive<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">存在于此的意义</span></p><p begin="02:55.657" end="02:58.380" itunes:key="L60">ひとつになろう You &amp; I<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让你我的心交织在一起</span></p><p begin="03:00.266" end="03:04.806" itunes:key="L61">ひとつになろう You &amp; I, I, I<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让你我的心交织在一起</span></p><p begin="03:05.086" end="03:07.357" itunes:key="L62">変わりゆく世界で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这瞬息万变的世界</span></p><p begin="03:07.616" end="03:12.178" itunes:key="L63">これからもふたりStay together forever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们从今以后</span></p><p begin="03:14.685" end="03:17.487" itunes:key="L64">ひとつになろう You &amp; I<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让你我的心交织在一起</span></p><p begin="03:21.651" end="03:26.127" itunes:key="L65">We will be together forever and ever<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们将永生永世相伴</span></p></div></body></tt>